flowchart TD
    REWARD["4. Continuous Reward Function<br/>(Distance Penalty -dist * 0.1 + Hit/Miss ±100)"]

    DISC["1. Spatial Discretizer<br/>(Maps continuous coords into 512-State Grid)"]
    LEARN["5. Bellman Equation Update & Q-Table Memory<br/>Q(s, a) += α [ R + γ max Q(s', a') - Q(s, a) ]"]

    POLICY["2. ε-Greedy Decision Policy<br/>(Explore Random 1.0 → Exploit Max Q 0.005)"]
    ACT["3. Execute Action {UP, DOWN, STAY}<br/>(Paddle moves towards ball: y += speed * dt)"]

    DISC -->|State ID| POLICY
    POLICY -->|Chosen Action| ACT
    ACT -->|Resulting Position| REWARD
    REWARD -->|Reward Signal| LEARN
    LEARN -.->|Feeds Updated Q-Values| POLICY

